    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Push-Forward Air Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/b145a805ab5addee3506242d0b5a17b2.poster.avif?t=1752004963\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/b145a805ab5addee3506242d0b5a17b2.webm?t=1752004963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/b145a805ab5addee3506242d0b5a17b2.mp4?t=1752004963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They Call It Gravity </strong>blends the intensity of modern push-forward shooters with the freedom of flight combat.  Move fast and dive into the fight to disrupt enemy formations, harvest energy and ammo from downed drones, disable air defenses to expand your flight zone.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Any Damage Matters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/4be2a0e98674c7fe879701539b813bc6.poster.avif?t=1752004963\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/4be2a0e98674c7fe879701539b813bc6.webm?t=1752004963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/4be2a0e98674c7fe879701539b813bc6.mp4?t=1752004963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift the physics in your favor by targeting enemy's weak points \u2014 disrupt their flight dynamics, reduce precision, and disable powerful attacks. But act fast \u2014 repair mosquito drones are on the move to repair them. Or become your next source of health\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Your Drone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/dc5d8f658b828626b7fd289f04641862.poster.avif?t=1752004963\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/dc5d8f658b828626b7fd289f04641862.webm?t=1752004963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/dc5d8f658b828626b7fd289f04641862.mp4?t=1752004963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your drone to enhance maneuverability and unlock a full arsenal of high-tech weapons \u2014 from precise railgun to devastating air vortexes. Master each tool and combine them with a variety of support drones to outplay constantly evolving enemy threats.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reignite the Machines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/bac8878958d1788717c2b2f98fc72cd4.poster.avif?t=1752004963\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/bac8878958d1788717c2b2f98fc72cd4.webm?t=1752004963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/bac8878958d1788717c2b2f98fc72cd4.mp4?t=1752004963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flight and fight in handcrafted arenas - both open and enclosed - set in power plants, spaceports, observatories and more. Bring massive engineering facilities back online in a fight for humanity\u2019s future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Push-Forward Air Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/b145a805ab5addee3506242d0b5a17b2.poster.avif?t=1752004963\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/b145a805ab5addee3506242d0b5a17b2.webm?t=1752004963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/b145a805ab5addee3506242d0b5a17b2.mp4?t=1752004963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They Call It Gravity </strong>blends the intensity of modern push-forward shooters with the freedom of flight combat.  Move fast and dive into the fight to disrupt enemy formations, harvest energy and ammo from downed drones, disable air defenses to expand your flight zone.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Any Damage Matters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/4be2a0e98674c7fe879701539b813bc6.poster.avif?t=1752004963\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/4be2a0e98674c7fe879701539b813bc6.webm?t=1752004963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/4be2a0e98674c7fe879701539b813bc6.mp4?t=1752004963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift the physics in your favor by targeting enemy's weak points \u2014 disrupt their flight dynamics, reduce precision, and disable powerful attacks. But act fast \u2014 repair mosquito drones are on the move to repair them. Or become your next source of health\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Your Drone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/dc5d8f658b828626b7fd289f04641862.poster.avif?t=1752004963\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/dc5d8f658b828626b7fd289f04641862.webm?t=1752004963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/dc5d8f658b828626b7fd289f04641862.mp4?t=1752004963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your drone to enhance maneuverability and unlock a full arsenal of high-tech weapons \u2014 from precise railgun to devastating air vortexes. Master each tool and combine them with a variety of support drones to outplay constantly evolving enemy threats.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reignite the Machines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/bac8878958d1788717c2b2f98fc72cd4.poster.avif?t=1752004963\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/bac8878958d1788717c2b2f98fc72cd4.webm?t=1752004963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759740/extras/bac8878958d1788717c2b2f98fc72cd4.mp4?t=1752004963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flight and fight in handcrafted arenas - both open and enclosed - set in power plants, spaceports, observatories and more. Bring massive engineering facilities back online in a fight for humanity\u2019s future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
